""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The Cosmos Needs Hunters. Are You Up for the Challenge?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An alien scourge ravages the cosmos. You are a HUNTER, the galaxy\u2019s elite defense. Deploy in this top-down roguelite arena shooter and take the fight to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter small, fast-paced arenas where you must eliminate all enemies. Engage in quick, action-packed missions, experiment with powerful abilities and augments, and unlock unique cosmetics to customize your appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The system\u2019s last hope rests on your trigger finger. Will you rise to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837680/extras/Marine.gif?t=1740756662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt down every enemy in short but challenging encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837680/extras/Augment.gif?t=1740756662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with a variety of skills and upgrades to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837680/extras/Crystal.gif?t=1740756662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Harvest crystals across diverse planets to unlock permanent upgrades and cosmetics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Good luck, Hunter.</i></p>","developers":["SmokeyAjax"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837680/header.jpg?t=1740756662","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"